Vulnerability data is fetched at run time from WPVulnerability
(https://www.wpvulnerability.net/). Exploit prediction scores come from the
EPSS model by FIRST (https://www.first.org/epss/). The Known Exploited
Vulnerabilities catalogue is published by CISA (https://www.cisa.gov/, CC0).
Core and plugin status come from the WordPress.org API. None of these
datasets is bundled in this distribution.
